{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/10/itm_71638b796ab7fd36/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06477","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-11T07:13:50Z","content_hash":"c6bed1c947698f084463eaa2d06d27ed113cf84ecb49ba4d1c771318e3ad77ac","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and metadata","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06477"},{"label":"arXiv cs.CR new listing for 2026-08-10","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.CR/new"},{"label":"StepJack code and dataset repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/BorealisAI/StepJack"},{"label":"RedTeamCUA upstream sandbox","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/RedTeamCUA"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.06477v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T07:13:50Z","fingerprint":"c6bed1c947698f084463eaa2d06d27ed113cf84ecb49ba4d1c771318e3ad77ac","id":"itm_71638b796ab7fd36","item_id":"itm_71638b796ab7fd36","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-10T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-08-10T00:00:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"StepJack 评测 computer-use agents 面对多步间接提示注入时是否还能拒绝攻击：攻击者把恶意目标拆成多个看似无害的子步骤，分散在 Agent 正常导航路径上的页面链中。论文用自动分解管线生成满足目标忠实和单步无害性的子步骤，基于 RedTeamCUA sandbox 构造每个 CUA 480 个样例，评估 6 个 CUA。关键结果是：在默认无 urgency cue 时，GPT-5.4-mini 的 ASR 从单步 41.7% 升到三步 72.9%，排除无法稳定跟随引用链的 EvoCUA-32B 后，5 个 CUA 平均 ASR 从 31.3% 升到 36.9%；局限是实验只跑单次、成本高、仅 12 个 adversarial goals 且 k<=3。","tags":["ai-safety","computer-use-agent","prompt-injection","benchmark","red-teaming"],"title":"StepJack: Benchmarking Computer-Use Agent Safety Against Multi-Step Indirect Prompt Injection","title_hash":"33251da928b19e5d37be3659ec75575fe2c886bd3c0d04c888ecc2fe78e194e4","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06477"}
